# You can add here your custom apt repositories

# r7-server (+r7apt1, corrected 2026-08-13): this fork's own patched-package
# overlay. Without this, any apt operation (a background PackageKit refresh,
# a manual "check for updates", or a plain `apt upgrade`) only sees the
# official Droidian repo, which happily "upgrades" our patched packages back
# down to stock the moment a matching name exists there. Signed with the key
# at /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/community-samsung-r7.gpg (this package ships it,
# same key shared with the phone edition), so no [trusted=yes] is needed.
#
# WAS pointed at note10lite-droidian/droidian-samsung-r7 (the PHONE edition's
# own repo) - a straight copy-paste artifact from forking this package off
# adaptation-samsung-r7, never corrected for the -server context. That repo
# publishes its OWN, unrelated package also named
# adaptation-samsung-r7-desktop (a real wayfire/fuzzel/wlr-randr desktop
# session), pinned at priority 1100 - so it collided with and tried to
# replace THIS fork's identically-named phoc-console package on every
# `apt upgrade`, confirmed live 2026-08-13 (AutoRemover aborted trying to
# resolve wayfire/fuzzel/wlr-randr deps that have nothing to do with this
# fork). Corrected to point at this fork's own repo instead.
deb https://raw.githubusercontent.com/note10lite-droidian/droidian-samsung-r7-server/droidian-101/apt/ ./
